---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const youtubeVideos = [
  { id: "X7LsqXgP3OE", title: "About Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop" },
  { id: "VjokdN58O80", title: "Dream to Design" },
  { id: "4CyfTb-V2bw", title: "Classic to Contemporary" },
];
---

<Layout title="About | Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-wood text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl text-darkwood mb-8">Creating Beautiful Cabinetry Since 1967</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop began over fifty years ago in a converted chicken house on a farm along the Snitz Creek in Lebanon, Pennsylvania. What started as a passion for creating elegance in homes has grown into a local icon for fine custom cabinetry.</p>
        <p>The tradition of hand-crafted cabinets from solid wood remains at the heart of what we do. As a family-owned and operated company, our reputation has spread throughout the region, and the demand for excellent cabinetry has grown well beyond the grassy banks of Snitz Creek.</p>
        <p>We take pride in our quality and design. Each year more people choose Snitz Creek to enhance the beauty of their kitchens, baths, and entertainment areas. In 2007 and 2008 we were honored with the prestigious LCBA Award for kitchen remodels and additions.</p>
        <p>Today we continue the same commitment: blending the precision of computerized equipment with the care of traditional hand skills.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Snitz Green -->
      <div class="mt-20 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-6">Snitz’s Green</h2>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start mb-10">
          <img 
            src="https://snitzcreek.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/green-handsmirrored-150x150-1.png" 
            alt="Hands holding the earth" 
            class="w-full max-w-xs mx-auto h-auto object-contain"
          />
          <div class="prose prose-lg text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
            <p>At Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop, we are committed to being good stewards of the earth and the natural resources we were given. Since 1996 we have been using a biomass heating system that supports environmental responsibility and economy. Biomass gasification boilers convert wood, sawdust and other organic waste products into usable heat.</p>
            <p>The environmental benefits of our wood gasification boiler are three-fold:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Reduce landfill waste: We recycle all our wood, laminate, cardboard and office by-products by converting them to heat energy.</li>
              <li>Reduce emissions: Our boiler converts wood to gas, then burns the gases. This gasification burning method reduces emissions and supports clean air.</li>
              <li>Maintain the carbon footprint: The EPA defines biomass consumption as “carbon neutral”. What this means is the carbon dioxide released by burning or decay equals the carbon dioxide stored by the growing tree.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Since we started heating with a gasification boiler, our oil consumption stopped. Every year we burn five to six thousand gallons less oil by using our waste! We are saving money with a speedy return on investment.</p>
            <p>We work with suppliers who ensure sustainable forestry. Ask us about going green with LEED certified products.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- YouTube Videos -->
      <div class="mt-20 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-8">Snitz Creek TV</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {youtubeVideos.map((video) => (
            <a 
              href={`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${video.id}`} 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener"
              class="group block"
            >
              <div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded bg-cream">
                <img 
                  src={`https://img.youtube.com/vi/${video.id}/hqdefault.jpg`} 
                  alt={video.title}
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500"
                />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/10 transition">
                  <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-cream/90 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-gold transition">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-darkwood ml-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-darkwood group-hover:text-wood">{video.title}</p>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-darkwood mb-6">Also from Snitz Creek</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/snitzgreen" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wood hover:text-darkwood text-lg font-medium">Snitz Green on Instagram</a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@snitzcreektv" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wood hover:text-darkwood text-lg font-medium">Snitz Creek TV</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
